# WHM/Apache include fragment; replace erp.example.com only after DNS/TLS setup.
ProxyPreserveHost On
ProxyRequests Off
RequestHeader set X-Forwarded-Proto "https"

ProxyPass        /websocket ws://127.0.0.1:8072/websocket timeout=600
ProxyPassReverse /websocket ws://127.0.0.1:8072/websocket
ProxyPass        / http://127.0.0.1:8069/ timeout=600
ProxyPassReverse / http://127.0.0.1:8069/

LimitRequestBody 134217728
